<title>USA: DuPont issues stock to complete Pfister buy.</title>
<headline>DuPont issues stock to complete Pfister buy.</headline>
<dateline>WILMINGTON, Del. 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>DuPont said Thursday it has issued 254,889 shares of common stock in exchange for all of the outstanding shares of Pfister Hybrid Corn Co.</p>
<p>The purchase concludes the acquisition of Pfister first announced Feb. 18, DuPont said.</p>
<p>DuPont said it will offset dilution by purchasing from time to time an equivalent number of shares to reduce shares outstanding by the amount issued to complete the Pfister purchase.</p>
</text>
